WEBVTT

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:59.768
[wind whistling softly]

00:01:09.694 --> 00:01:11.988
[wood creaking]

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:17.160
[growls]

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:19.162
-Quiet!
-[growls]

00:01:27.796 --> 00:01:29.172
What are you?

00:01:29.672 --> 00:01:31.049
Shh.

00:01:31.508 --> 00:01:32.592
-[growling]
-Oh.

00:01:35.553 --> 00:01:37.096
[both grunting]

00:01:44.312 --> 00:01:45.146
[screams]

00:01:47.732 --> 00:01:49.025
Ahhh! You're a demon!

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:52.403
[shushing] No, no.
I'm not a demon. I'm not a demon.

00:01:52.946 --> 00:01:54.572
See? Just a guy.

00:01:54.656 --> 00:01:57.033
Just a guy here
to rescue these dragons, so...

00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:58.493
But you walked through fire!

00:01:58.576 --> 00:02:00.787
Dragon scales! Dragons shed a lot.

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:02.872
No, I know a demon when I see one.

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:04.499
No human legs are that skinny.

00:02:04.582 --> 00:02:05.875
-[roars]
-[screams]

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:07.418
Think that's a good entrance?

00:02:07.502 --> 00:02:08.753
Get a load of me.

00:02:09.045 --> 00:02:10.296
[screaming]

00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:13.550
Aah! I knew it! More demons!

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:16.386
Ah, it's really just a nitwit
who forgot to fireproof his butt.

00:02:16.511 --> 00:02:17.637
[Snotlout] Hot, hot, hot, hot!

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:19.597
-Guys, no, not yet!
-[sparks crackling]

00:02:19.722 --> 00:02:20.932
Ahhh!

00:02:21.141 --> 00:02:23.268
[Tuffnut] Behold, your worst nightmare.

00:02:23.351 --> 00:02:24.352
[Ruffnut] Behold.

00:02:24.435 --> 00:02:26.563
Along with his sister,
who insisted on coming.

00:02:26.646 --> 00:02:27.897
That's my intro?

00:02:27.981 --> 00:02:30.900
Guys, too soon.
You always come in too soon.

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:32.360
[Fishlegs screams and grunts]

00:02:32.443 --> 00:02:35.238
[Fishlegs] Sorry, still getting the hang
of my wings.

00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:37.073
Fishlegs, again with the baby?

00:02:37.157 --> 00:02:38.408
[chitters happily]

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:39.492
This is a raid.

00:02:39.576 --> 00:02:41.202
[Fishlegs] I couldn't find a sitter.

00:02:41.286 --> 00:02:43.329
Demons everywhere!
It's the end of the world!

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:45.582
[gasps and groans]

00:02:46.082 --> 00:02:47.167
[Hiccup] Astrid.

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:49.085
I had him right where I wanted him.

00:02:49.168 --> 00:02:51.129
And now, he's right where I wanted him.

00:02:51.212 --> 00:02:52.380
Let's get to work.

00:02:52.463 --> 00:02:54.090
[Hiccup] Okay, we screwed that up,

00:02:54.173 --> 00:02:56.134
but at least nobody else knows we're here.

00:02:57.927 --> 00:02:59.804
[growls]

00:03:00.096 --> 00:03:02.265
Easy, girl. It's okay.

00:03:02.348 --> 00:03:03.349
[snarls]

00:03:03.433 --> 00:03:04.976
Shh. We're gonna get you out of here.

00:03:05.059 --> 00:03:06.060
[purrs]

00:03:06.352 --> 00:03:07.687
[door creaks]

00:03:08.021 --> 00:03:10.481
[Fishlegs gasps] A Crimson Goregutter.

00:03:10.857 --> 00:03:12.609
[Fishlegs cooing]

00:03:12.942 --> 00:03:14.110
[chitters]

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:15.778
[soft growl]

00:03:16.487 --> 00:03:19.866
[Ruffnut laughs]
Look at this weirdo. Bet it's super dumb.

00:03:20.116 --> 00:03:21.576
[grunting]

00:03:21.659 --> 00:03:23.578
Why can't I get this cage open?

00:03:23.661 --> 00:03:24.829
It slides.

00:03:24.913 --> 00:03:26.623
[scoffs] Obviously.

00:03:26.706 --> 00:03:27.707
[guard in distance] Attack!

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:30.543
-Get the rescues out of here!
-[guard] Get that Night Fury!

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:33.588
-[all grunting]
-[blades clanging]

00:03:34.297 --> 00:03:35.465
Oh!

00:03:35.548 --> 00:03:38.718
[Tuffnut] No running on the deck!
It's slippery. You could fall.

00:03:38.801 --> 00:03:41.221
Step aside. Let me handle
the tough-guy stuff.

00:03:41.304 --> 00:03:42.347
-[grunts]
-[guards chuckle]

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:43.473
-Huh?
-Whoa.

00:03:43.556 --> 00:03:45.141
-[guards screaming]
-Oh.

00:03:45.225 --> 00:03:46.809
Yeah! That's two for me.

00:03:46.893 --> 00:03:48.228
[Hookfang snarls]

00:03:51.064 --> 00:03:53.066
-[guard grunts]
-[Snotlout] Look out! No, no, no!

00:03:53.149 --> 00:03:54.692
Sorry. [grunts]

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:56.736
[yells]

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:58.905
[all grunting]

00:04:00.615 --> 00:04:01.658
[Astrid] Ha!

00:04:03.576 --> 00:04:04.661
Thank you.

00:04:04.744 --> 00:04:06.120
Now, go get the rest, bud.

00:04:06.204 --> 00:04:07.288
[Astrid grunting]

00:04:08.581 --> 00:04:10.792
I thought this was supposed
to be a stealth mission.

00:04:10.875 --> 00:04:12.210
Yeah, they always start that way.

00:04:12.293 --> 00:04:13.795
-Look out!
-[guard grunting]

00:04:14.879 --> 00:04:16.256
[guard screams]

00:04:16.339 --> 00:04:17.715
-[water splashes]
-[Astrid] Thanks, Stormfly!

00:04:19.759 --> 00:04:22.262
-[grunts]
-Oh, stop worrying. They'll get it.

00:04:23.263 --> 00:04:25.139
[yells and grunts]

00:04:26.015 --> 00:04:27.016
[gasps]

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:28.559
-Eventually.
-[grunts]

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:31.104
Move out! We've got 'em all.

00:04:31.187 --> 00:04:33.189
I'm gonna headlock every last one of you.

00:04:33.273 --> 00:04:35.692
-I might even leglock you.
-[Ruffnut laughs]

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:38.653
[Snotlout] Amateurs!
I was just getting started.

00:04:38.736 --> 00:04:40.655
[Astrid] Clear out, guys. Go, go!

00:04:40.905 --> 00:04:42.699
[guards shouting]

00:04:45.159 --> 00:04:46.661
[Fishlegs] Whoo!

00:04:47.495 --> 00:04:48.913
[Hiccup] Good hustle, boys.

00:04:48.997 --> 00:04:50.164
[sniffing]

00:04:51.416 --> 00:04:53.584
-Toothless, time to go!
-[grunts]

00:04:59.173 --> 00:05:00.341
-[guards chuckling]
-Oh.

00:05:01.676 --> 00:05:03.553
-Hey, guys.
-[guard chuckles]

00:05:03.636 --> 00:05:04.804
-[guards grunting]
-[gasps]

00:05:07.724 --> 00:05:10.393
[Hiccup] Ha-ha!
You always have my back, bud.

00:05:10.476 --> 00:05:11.894
[Toothless roars]

00:05:14.272 --> 00:05:16.816
[dragons calling]

00:05:27.201 --> 00:05:31.122
This is Berk.
Your new home away from home.

00:05:31.205 --> 00:05:34.792
A stunning, one-stop,
all-expense-paid dream destination.

00:05:36.627 --> 00:05:39.422
So, settle in
and let your worries melt away.

00:05:40.757 --> 00:05:44.218
The service here soars,
the cuisine is fiery,

00:05:45.928 --> 00:05:48.514
and the locals are as colorful as you get.

00:05:49.599 --> 00:05:53.436
Any run-of-the-mill paradise
boasts beaches and sunshine.

00:05:54.729 --> 00:05:55.646
Well, not us.

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:58.357
We've got something no one else can touch.

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:02.487
We, my friend, have dragons.

00:06:03.696 --> 00:06:06.657
Lots and lots of dragons.

00:06:07.366 --> 00:06:09.035
[roars]

00:06:10.328 --> 00:06:12.789
-[panicked shouting]
-[sheep bleating]

00:06:16.125 --> 00:06:18.669
Gang, meet our latest Berkians.

00:06:18.753 --> 00:06:19.796
[roars]

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:22.757
Welcome to paradise, mate.

00:06:23.132 --> 00:06:24.717
Well, aren't you a beauty.

00:06:24.801 --> 00:06:27.011
Aw, you're welcome. You're welcome.

00:06:27.095 --> 00:06:30.264
I took on, like, 100 trappers.
1,000 trappers.

00:06:30.348 --> 00:06:31.891
All with burning undies. [cackling]

00:06:31.974 --> 00:06:35.061
My thick, full beard
almost caught on fire.

00:06:35.144 --> 00:06:37.105
Ugh, just... Just stop.

00:06:37.188 --> 00:06:38.981
So, uh, Hiccup's mom,

00:06:39.065 --> 00:06:42.652
any notes on my bone-crushing assault
or was it pretty much perfect?

00:06:42.735 --> 00:06:45.363
Oh, it was indescribable.

00:06:45.446 --> 00:06:48.366
And please, call me Valka.
It has been a year.

00:06:48.449 --> 00:06:49.951
First-name basis.

00:06:50.034 --> 00:06:52.662
I think the real hero of the day
was Toothless.

00:06:52.745 --> 00:06:54.413
Isn't that right, bud?

00:06:54.497 --> 00:06:57.208
What would we do without you,
O king of dragons?

00:06:57.291 --> 00:06:58.668
-[purring]
-What would we do?

00:06:58.751 --> 00:07:01.337
Well, we could train a lot harder,
for one.

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:03.005
That was pretty sloppy.

00:07:03.089 --> 00:07:06.008
[chuckles] Astrid, uh, does have a point.

00:07:06.092 --> 00:07:09.387
Perhaps you all rely
a little bit too much on your dragons

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:11.973
and not enough on one another.

00:07:12.056 --> 00:07:14.100
See? That's exactly what I was saying.

00:07:14.183 --> 00:07:15.309
Just listen up, guys.

00:07:15.476 --> 00:07:17.562
Yeah, your mom's super-impressed with me.

00:07:17.645 --> 00:07:19.313
I'm like the son she always wanted.

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:21.482
-[chittering]
-Fishmeat.

00:07:21.983 --> 00:07:23.401
You found a new friend.

00:07:23.734 --> 00:07:24.819
[growls softly]

00:07:25.486 --> 00:07:27.071
[roaring playfully]

00:07:27.738 --> 00:07:29.323
-Mind your heads!
-Whoa!

